flowchart LR
  subgraph Context[Scoped company context]
    R[Registry / portfolio]
    K[Kanban / repositories]
    D[Decisions / goals]
    E[Accepted evidence]
  end

  V[Validation + provenance classifier] --> O
  R --> V
  K --> V
  D --> V
  E --> V

  subgraph Engine[Founder Palace learning engine]
    O[ORIENT] --> M[MAP]
    M --> F[FOCUS]
    F --> A[ACT]
    A --> B[OBSERVE]
    B --> T[RETRIEVE]
    T --> U[UPDATE]
    U --> O
  end

  M <--> G[(Versioned FounderKnowledgeItem graph)]
  B <--> G
  T <--> G
  U <--> G

  C[Hermes coach\ntruth classes + uncertainty] <--> Engine
  P[Explicit approval boundary] --> X[Owning external system]
  C --> P

  S[Spatial settlement adapter] --> C
  L[Accessible list/text adapter] --> C
  H[History + interruption-safe session state] --> C

  X --> Q[Authoritative receipt]
  Q --> V
